{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sphere Game you take control over a sphere in 3rd person view and your goal is to pass through difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: find out how to progress the map and try to do so in the least possible amount of attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also hidden coins waiting for you to collect, which can then be used to unlock levels/cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/5e3c545bbd90a7a0fd12b0b3964296e0.avif?t=1760717358\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous ways to unlock new areas in the maps in order to progress. This is the perfect moment for you to use your searching skills. The buttons can be hidden anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.poster.avif?t=1760717358\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.webm?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.mp4?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/4e9012a024fcb392431186dbd35558b6.avif?t=1760717358\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing different maps you will stumble upon traps. That's for sure. Some will require you to properly time your actions. Are you ready to give it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/43bd9f1c451c725f76a35cc79c12291b.poster.avif?t=1760717358\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/43bd9f1c451c725f76a35cc79c12291b.webm?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/43bd9f1c451c725f76a35cc79c12291b.mp4?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068190?t=1760717358","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/e05ec5efdc789f9772e4cb88c813dfd38fd7e74f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760717358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/34cc3e2bf075a8169766091775271e82e99aebdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760717358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/34cc3e2bf075a8169766091775271e82e99aebdd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760717358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sphere Game you take control over a sphere in 3rd person view and your goal is to pass through difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: find out how to progress the map and try to do so in the least possible amount of attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also hidden coins waiting for you to collect, which can then be used to unlock levels/cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/5e3c545bbd90a7a0fd12b0b3964296e0.avif?t=1760717358\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous ways to unlock new areas in the maps in order to progress. This is the perfect moment for you to use your searching skills. The buttons can be hidden anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.poster.avif?t=1760717358\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.webm?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/f96908aafd3bb43c7fcdafe6324ead52.mp4?t=1760717358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068190/extras/4e9012a024fcb392431186dbd35558b6.avif?t=1760717358\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing different maps you will stumble upon traps. That's for sure. Some will require you to properly time your actions. Are you ready to give it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragra